{"title": "Genial Strider", "pageid": 28416, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Genial_Strider", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Genial Strider</b> is a passive feature that makes difficult terrain easy to traverse.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> is unimpeded by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Genial_Striding\" title=\"Boots of Genial Striding\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Boots_of_Genial_Striding_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_of_Genial_Striding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Boots_of_Genial_Striding_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Boots_of_Genial_Striding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Boots_of_Genial_Striding_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Boots_of_Genial_Striding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Boots_of_Genial_Striding_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_of_Genial_Striding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Boots_of_Genial_Striding_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Genial_Striding\" title=\"Boots of Genial Striding\">Boots of Genial Striding</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Genial Strider</b> prevents movement speed reduction from the following types of areas: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lava\" title=\"Lava\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Lava_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Lava_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Lava_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Lava_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Lava_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Lava_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lava\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Lava_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Lava_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Lava_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lava\" title=\"Lava\">Lava</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mud\" title=\"Mud\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mud\" title=\"Mud\">Mud</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Plant_Growth\" title=\"Plant Growth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/20px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/30px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/40px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Plant Growth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp/20px-Plant_Growth_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Plant_Growth_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Plant_Growth\" title=\"Plant Growth\">Plant Growth</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Twisting_Vines\" title=\"Twisting Vines\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Roots_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Roots_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Roots_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Roots_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Roots_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Roots_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Twisting Vines\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Roots_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Roots_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Roots_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Twisting_Vines\" title=\"Twisting Vines\">Twisting Vines</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Web_(surface)\" title=\"Web (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Web_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Web_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Web_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Web\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Web_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Web_(surface)\" title=\"Web (surface)\">Web</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Genial Strider</b> does not prevent movement speed reduction from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Deep_Water_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Deep Water (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain: Deep Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Deep_Water_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Deep Water (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain: Deep Water</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215427\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.083 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2957/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25302/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument